WEBVTT

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:04.000
I'm home.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:08.230
Kaede-san, my friends 
are coming over later...

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:15.630
I wonder if Kaede-san's out somewhere.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.140
What is it, Pochi?

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:20.940
A letter?

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.260
And this package...

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:27.280
<i>I'm leaving on urgent business.</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:32.160
<i>My brother sent us another package, 
so I'm going to leave it on the table.</i>

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:36.300
<i>I took a look just in case, but it 
seems to be a normal decoration.</i>

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>Bluarrghh</b>

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:44.770
<i>I think it's safe to open this time.</i>

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.290
<i>How, exactly?!</i>

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:21.070
#10
A Fun Surprise from Afar

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:19.570
<b>Haaaaaaaaurgh</b>

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:21.700
What do I do?

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:25.450
I should take Mii-kun and 
Pochi somewhere safe first.

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:28.770
Hello?

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:30.820
<i>Kashiwagi, it's me.</i>

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.090
<i>I'm not home at the moment.</i>

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:36.210
You're here. What the hell 
are you talking about?

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:39.640
<i>Sorry, Tazuki, I'm in the 
middle of something right now.</i>

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:41.840
<i>Thanks for coming, but,</i>

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:44.510
<i>today, um...</i>

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:46.220
<i>Yeah, I have sudden business.</i>

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:47.580
Huh?

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:48.420
Tazuki?

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.850
"In the middle of something," my ass.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:58.450
You seem to really want me gone.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:01.240
Why did you invite yourself 
in if you knew that?

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:03.990
So... what'd you get this time?

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:08.630
Your dad sent you a weird 
package again, didn't he?

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:12.610
That's always the reason you 
tell me not to come over.

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:14.760
All right, all right.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:16.130
Please come in.

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:18.680
I can't guarantee you'll make it out alive.

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:20.430
Is it that bad?

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:25.890
<b>Heuuuuuurgh</b>

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:24.900
It looks bad.

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:25.890
See?

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:30.870
All right.

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:36.000
Tazuki, can you take Pochi, 
Mii-kun and Conny outside?

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.260
Also, there's a stick in the yard.

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:40.460
Can you use that, Tazuki?

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:41.900
All right.

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:48.250
I don't see a stick...

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:51.180
You lied to me!

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:52.730
Sorry.

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:56.330
I can't let you fight when 
it's obviously dangerous.

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:59.300
That's what you always do!

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:01.020
Kashiwagi!

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:07.590
Open up, damn it!

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:08.640
I'm going to help!

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:11.220
My name is Anubis.

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:14.520
Japanese boy,

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:18.650
you shall call me Aayan.

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:29.030
Japanese boy,

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:31.770
I am quite disappointed.

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:38.590
I presented myself on my own and 
introduced myself humorously.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:41.680
How dare you threaten me with a stick?

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:44.260
I am more hurt than I have ever been!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.330
You do not need me, do you, boy?

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:52.020
I am the only Anubis that speaks this much.

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:54.820
I want to go home to Egypt!

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:57.020
Uh, I...

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:00.400
Would you mind opening the door?

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:06.960
Wait, you can't walk by yourself?

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.290
Of course not.

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:12.860
I'm a sculpture. 
My limbs are stuck to my body.

00:05:12.860 --> 00:05:15.530
I'm going to ask before I 
take you out of the box...

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:18.190
You don't plan to attack me, do you?

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:21.800
You're the one who was about to attack me!

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:22.770
Right.

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:23.870
Sorry.

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:27.430
So you aren't going to curse 
us or anything, either, are you?

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:33.430
Why do you speak of such terrifying 
things? Attacking, cursing...

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:36.280
Is something troubling you? 
Want to talk about it with me?

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:38.310
Oh, I'm fine.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.050
Listen, young man...

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:43.960
I was at a gift shop in Egypt, when...

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.950
I think he's harmless.

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:45.210
No, I think we should still be careful.

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:48.570
Sorry, did you say something?

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:53.330
I was at a gift shop in Egypt...

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.700
He's completely bummed out.

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:05.960
I see, so my dad bought 
you and sent you here.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:06.910
Yes.

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:10.410
Your father had a very hard time deciding.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.280
What should I get?

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:21.520
The Daruma doll, the 
scarecrow, the Mary doll...

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:24.360
Everything scared Sora.

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:27.910
I want to send him something 
normal this time.

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:32.810
It also has to be something awesome 
that speaks to his inner child.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.610
Huh, an Anubis figurine.

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:39.450
Sora likes dogs,

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:43.000
and Anubis is supposed to 
be the god of mummification.

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:46.510
He might like this one.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.080
Let's send this one.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:51.500
Dad said that?

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:55.550
I could have told him that 
I'm not a normal figurine,

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:58.280
but I chose to stay quiet until I got here.

00:06:58.280 --> 00:06:59.770
Why so?

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:01.870
I wanted to tell you.

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:07.400
That your father worked really 
hard to choose a gift for you.

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:09.180
Aayan...

00:07:09.180 --> 00:07:10.150
Besides,

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:14.680
I figured, it would be nice to 
see the world from aboard a ship.

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:18.290
But he put me in a box, 
so I couldn't see crap!

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:21.840
<i>I can't hate this guy.</i>

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:26.340
By the way, what's that 
white one on your shoulder?

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:29.350
Oh, this is Mii-kun the mummy.

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:31.140
Come, Mii-kun.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:42.440
This creature isn't a mummy.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.460
Huh?

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:44.440
What do you mean?

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:49.870
The lizard mummy dried up next to me at 
the street stall was totally shriveled up.

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:50.860
Uh...

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:52.990
Well, let's take a look.

00:07:58.170 --> 00:07:59.940
Wait, what are you doing?!

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:04.380
Fear not, my tender nibbling 
is famous for being pleasant.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:05.750
Tender nibbling?

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.880
To whom is it famous?

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:10.260
This texture,

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:13.960
this softness, this chewiness...

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:15.890
It's addicting, but not 
overbearing in flavor.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:18.410
You're starting to sound like a food critic.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:21.160
Mii-kun seems to be enjoying it.

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:25.650
I wonder if it's like getting a massage.

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:26.700
Nope.

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:29.020
It is definitely not a mummy.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:34.450
Mii-kun's living, so he's not the 
same as a normal mummy, Aayan.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:35.470
Indeed.

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:36.990
<i>He's convinced?</i>

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:39.200
To think that there's a living mummy...

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.410
There sure is a lot to see in this world.

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:46.170
Now, young man, it is my turn to show 
you something interesting.

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:47.940
Are you going to show me something?

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:49.090
Yes.

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:53.080
Believe it or not, I can tell the future.

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:53.830
You can?!

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:55.100
That's amazing!

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:56.860
What kind of things can you predict?

00:08:57.630 --> 00:08:58.930
Watch carefully.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.030
It's going to rain tonight!

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:07.190
I can see that.

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:10.320
We're having curry tonight!

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:12.480
You just looked at the ingredients.

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:15.130
Sorry, it's actually meat and potatoes.

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:23.000
Mii-kun's gotten used to you, too.

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:26.680
You're both from Egypt. 
I hope that you'll become good friends.

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:28.660
Yes, of course.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:33.830
But speaking of Egypt, I sense 
that I'm forgetting something.

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:35.000
Hey...

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:38.890
There's something at the bottom of your box.

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:40.100
Oh, right.

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:43.510
You have another gift, in addition to myself.

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:48.850
A letter, and... What's this?

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:50.360
Wait, Tazuki!

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:51.690
Don't touch it bare-handed!

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.430
My dad sent that!

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:55.710
It might not be something ordinary!

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:57.660
Also, something isn't right.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:58.610
What isn't?

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:01.620
The letter's shorter than usual.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:03.160
That's more than enough.

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:05.000
You should be worried that it's too long.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:09.120
Your father said he would 
send some sand from Egypt.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:10.530
Sand?

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:12.350
That can't be dangerous, then.

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:14.510
There might be a sphinx inside!

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:15.880
No way.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.480
Just stay back.

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:20.670
It could transform into a golem.

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:22.890
Or there might be scorpions.

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:33.110
It's just sand.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.310
This sucks!

00:10:35.310 --> 00:10:36.650
There, there.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:38.650
<b>Whoooa</b>

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:40.870
Mii-kun seems really happy.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:43.410
Maybe he can tell that it's Egyptian sand.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:47.350
I wonder what Conny's doing.

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:49.400
He's probably pissed about something.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:52.570
Are you disappointed or something?

00:10:54.350 --> 00:10:56.700
Mii-kun, want to play in the sand?

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:00.930
All right.

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:03.210
Calm down!

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:06.310
<b>Whoooa</b>

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:06.310
You're getting yourself squished!
You're losing your form!

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:08.760
There you go, Mii-kun, it's sand.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.060
Kashiwagi!

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:12.190
Are you all right? 
You got sand blasted in your face.

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:13.210
I'm okay.

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:14.740
I stopped it with my right hand.

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:16.330
You hardly did.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:18.660
What's with the happy smile?

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:21.070
He's just so cute, enjoying the sand.

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:28.780
It's okay.

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:30.960
Good for you for getting sand.

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:34.020
I'm sure your homeland is special to you.

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:36.840
I hope we can go to Egypt together someday.

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:47.720
Hello.

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:49.180
Welcome.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:50.440
Thanks for having us.

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:55.470
We have a new friend that 
I want to introduce you to.

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:57.830
Excellent, Pocchan!

00:11:57.830 --> 00:11:59.740
You run well!

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:05.460
He crashed!

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:06.680
Hurry!

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:08.240
Hurry up and right me!

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:12.240
I'm sorry you had to see that.

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:15.170
First impressions are important.

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:19.250
I am the Anubis of this household, Aayahhh—

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:22.590
Hey! Too far! Back up!

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:24.700
How polite.

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:26.810
Nice to meet you, Aayan.

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:27.850
Indeed.

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:31.100
He looks like a figurine, but he has wheels.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.350
Oh, about that...

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:35.350
I just have him on a dolly.

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:37.220
Stop that, Soraino!

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:39.360
I can't move without it!

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:40.670
It's so cute.

00:12:40.670 --> 00:12:42.490
Is Soraino your nickname?

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.120
Yeah.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:44.610
He seems to like nicknames.

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:46.830
Oh, really?

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:49.820
Aayan-dono, can you give me a nickname?

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.240
It's eating Isao!

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:55.190
Not to worry, it's pleasurable.

00:12:55.190 --> 00:12:58.320
Sorry, Aayan seems to like to nibble things.

00:12:58.320 --> 00:12:58.940
Indeed.

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:00.210
This is skinship.

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.280
Oh, okay.

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:02.510
You scared me.

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:06.540
You're quite...

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:12.450
Very comfortable to the touch.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:25.720
It disappeared!

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:28.210
Soraino, Muku disappeared!

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:31.400
It popped because I prodded at it!

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:32.450
What have I done?!

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:34.940
Don't worry, he's over there.

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:41.360
By the way, what's an Anubis?

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:44.260
A god of the underworld 
from Egyptian mythology.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:48.920
Of course, a god would never 
get caught by a human, so...

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:51.840
Yeah, Aayan is a tsukumogami.

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:52.680
Tsukumogami?

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:56.060
It's an inanimate object that bears a soul.

00:13:56.060 --> 00:14:00.610
You know how when you lose 
something or break something

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:04.670
you've been using for a long time, 
they say it sacrificed itself for you?

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:07.030
Those are a kind of tsukumogami, too.

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:10.820
Whether it's another human 
or an inanimate object,

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:13.960
the more you care for them, 
the more they care for you.

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:15.290
That's the idea.

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:18.530
Huh, that's a fun story.

00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:20.910
Huh, does that mean

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:24.300
Grandpa the Ojizou statue 
is a tsukumogami, too?

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:26.210
Bingo.

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:27.350
I see.

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:29.650
I've wondering about that, actually.

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:33.880
If Grandpa was an Ojizou 
statue since he was born...

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:37.950
Hey, you aren't wearing your usual hair ties.

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:40.060
Yeah, my friend gave me these.

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:41.630
Oh, really?

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:43.230
They look really good on you.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.190
They're cute.

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:46.200
Really? Thanks.

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:48.420
I totally didn't notice.

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:49.900
Sorry, Acchan.

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:51.390
No worries.

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:54.450
<i>Oh, yeah, this guy's always been...</i>

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:57.620
I love you, Tazuki-kun.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.210
Uh...

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:03.260
You're growing out your bangs? Nice.

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:05.840
You're good-looking. You can totally rock it.

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:07.160
Thanks.

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.410
Whoa, Kaede-san's so pretty.

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:12.860
Look, she's like an angel.

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:15.810
Please don't, Sora-kun!

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:21.030
<i>He's never hesitated to say things like that.</i>

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:23.360
<i>I can't believe it doesn't embarrass him.</i>

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:28.560
<i>Does he even </i>get<i> embarrassed?</i>

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:32.450
<i>Come to think of it, 
I've never seen him embarrassed.</i>

00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:36.390
What's up, Tazuki, is something on your mind?

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:39.000
What's wrong, Sora-chan?

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:42.010
Oh, it's nothing.

00:15:42.650 --> 00:15:44.280
Ah, hiccups.

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:45.600
Are you okay?

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:47.430
Sorry, I...

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:50.050
I-I'm going to do the laundry.

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:52.460
You were putting your laundry away just now.

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:54.760
N-No, I...

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:58.440
Are you embarrassed?

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:00.060
You are, aren't you?

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:02.720
Why won't you just let me go?!

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:07.250
No, I'm relieved that you have such emotions.

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:09.500
Although, I don't really understand 
what triggers it for you.

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:10.720
Say what?

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:16.240
Sora-kun, have some water.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:19.270
Hiccups suck.

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:20.870
I'm okay.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:23.540
I hope they go away.

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:29.210
Oh, yeah, I heard that if you 
have a hundred hiccups, you die.

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.160
Yeah, I remember that.

00:16:36.150 --> 00:16:39.540
I know, how about we try scaring him?

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:43.270
Scare him?

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.270
Scare him?

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:45.120
Oh, yeah, I've heard of that.

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:56.570
Actually, there's a trick 
I want to try first.

00:16:56.980 --> 00:17:01.150
Try drinking your water with 
your mouth on the opposite rim.

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:03.660
That's just crazy.

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:05.330
Huh, Mii-kun?

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:07.960
There's some white thing on your body.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:14.340
Mii's bandage is coming undone.

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:16.090
Mii-kun!

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:18.180
Aayan got water on him!

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:19.680
What's wrong, Mii-kun?

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:20.310
What's happening?!

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:25.070
Wait, Mii-kun, let's go to the hospital!

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:27.550
Conny! Isao!

00:17:27.550 --> 00:17:28.900
Why are you getting in my way?

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.650
No, Isao, come over here.

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:34.300
He's trying to undo his bandage even more.

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.150
We have to catch—

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:36.670
<i>No, wait...</i>

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:40.450
<i>If he keeps going, we might get 
to see what's inside Mii.</i>

00:17:41.270 --> 00:17:46.150
<i>I tried to find the end of his 
bandage before, but I just couldn't.</i>

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:50.060
<i>I may never get another 
opportunity if I pass this one up.</i>

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:51.930
Let's flank him!

00:17:51.930 --> 00:17:53.050
Mogi-chan, that way!

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:55.050
Tazuki!

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:55.920
What the hell are you—

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:58.990
Kashiwagi, I just realized...

00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:01.810
Mii is trying to take 
the bandage off himself.

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:05.360
There's nothing to worry about.

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:06.560
Dude...

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:09.070
You just want to see what's 
inside Mii-kun, don't you?

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:09.670
Yeah.

00:18:09.670 --> 00:18:10.810
Seriously?!

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.000
Go, Miiyan!

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:13.290
Get him, Soraino!

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:13.930
Let me go!

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:15.440
Uh... What am I supposed to do?

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.610
What if something happens?!

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:17.720
<i>Sora-chan's freaking out...</i>

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:17.720
Mii-kun!

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:20.200
<i>I don't think that bandage 
is supposed to come off.</i>

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:19.870
Mii-kun!

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:22.990
<i>He's being held down for some reason.</i>

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:25.020
<i>I have to stop Mii-kun!</i>

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.620
Yes! I got it!

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:32.000
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:34.850
That's enough, Tazuki!

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:38.260
Look, Kashiwagi, it's almost off.

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:41.980
Is something bright?

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:42.990
Is what?

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:46.100
No, the whole room is weirdly bright...

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:49.730
Now's my chance!

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:50.980
Mii-kun!

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:52.930
What was that?

00:18:53.390 --> 00:18:55.360
Everything just turned dark for a second.

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:57.260
Mii-kun!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:01.200
Come here, Mii-kun.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.240
You can't take your bandage off.

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:06.800
Mii-kun...

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:12.450
<i>Dad's letter said almost 
nothing about Mii-kun,</i>

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:16.000
Order: Mummy
Family: Mummy
Species: Mummy
Characteristics: Small
Warning: Don't take the bandage off

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:15.280
<i>but it did say not to remove the bandage.</i>

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:16.000
Pervert!

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:20.510
What if you take your bandage off 
and something bad happens to you?

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:29.950
Mii-kun?

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:33.090
Why do you want to take your 
bandage off in the first place?

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:34.860
Is there a reason?

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:38.900
What's wrong, Isao?

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:43.320
What happened to you all?

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:44.890
You're all hiccuping.

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:45.910
Hiccups?

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:49.310
Were you listening to what we were saying?

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:51.960
Were you trying to stop Sora-chan's hiccups?

00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:55.720
Just to be sure...

00:19:56.600 --> 00:19:59.720
You know that thing about dying after a 
hundred hiccups is superstition, right?

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:06.310
You did that for me?

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:07.860
Thanks, Mii-kun.

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:13.650
And they lived happily ever after...

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:15.490
Not that we did anything.

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:20.390
Um... Huh?

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:22.330
How did this go on?

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:24.980
He's tilting his head.

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:28.360
Look at the time.

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:30.040
We should get going.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:33.040
Sorry we couldn't hang out properly.

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:35.100
Not at all, Sora-chan.

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:37.020
It was really fun.

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:38.330
Right, Dai-chan?

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:39.050
Yeah.

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:42.980
Mii-kun, say bye-bye to everyone.

00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:43.780
Huh?

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:46.000
He's back to normal.

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:48.710
I can't even find the end.

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:51.770
Thanks for having us.

00:20:51.920 --> 00:20:53.170
Come back soon.

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:58.380
This place has totally turned 
into a zoo of weirdos.

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:02.950
Come to think of it, 
Pochi's the only normal dog here.

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:03.530
Huh?

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:04.660
Huh?

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:08.140
Pochi's estimated to be fifty years old this year.

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:10.270
This dog lives for hundreds of years.

00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:12.580
He's been around since before I was born.

00:21:13.820 --> 00:21:16.250
That's the most shocking revelation today!

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:21.060
Aayan the Anubis, huh?

00:21:21.060 --> 00:21:24.760
I was completely convinced that 
you were just a normal figurine.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:26.030
Of course.

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:29.380
No one would expect a figurine to talk.

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:31.920
Alas, I speak.

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:34.770
Things are will be even more lively now.

00:21:36.550 --> 00:21:39.370
Do you want to play in 
the sand again, Mii-kun?

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:42.780
What's wrong?

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:47.460
That tickles.

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:49.450
You're being a baby today, huh?

00:21:50.090 --> 00:21:50.780
Soraino...

00:21:51.730 --> 00:21:52.660
What is it?

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:54.100
Thank you.

00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:56.170
Today was a fun day.

00:21:57.660 --> 00:22:01.920
I didn't get to see the sea, 
but I'm glad I came here.

00:22:02.660 --> 00:22:08.610
It's so nice to have someone to talk to.

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:10.290
Aayan...

00:22:12.150 --> 00:22:14.420
You're welcome to stay 
for as long as you'd like.

00:22:14.420 --> 00:22:16.080
I look forward to it.

00:22:16.080 --> 00:22:18.460
Indeed. I'll be in your care.

00:23:50.670 --> 00:23:54.990
Mii-kun's treasures are acorns, 
marbles, and lizard toys.

00:23:54.990 --> 00:23:57.010
He seems to be hiding them under the bed.

00:23:57.010 --> 00:24:00.340
I have to be careful not to suck 
them up with the vacuum cleaner.

00:23:59.660 --> 00:24:04.630
Next Episode
I Want to Be With You Forever and Ever

00:24:00.690 --> 00:24:01.910
<i>How to Keep a Mummy</i>.

00:24:01.910 --> 00:24:03.480
See you next time.

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:07.710
<b>See you next time!</b>
